        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.riveroakstx.com/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The city lies within the Loop 820 five‑mile radius around Fort Worth, part of the Dallas‑Fort Worth Metroplex.",
